                                                "sense_id": "2272024a-37d6-3fb1-bded-6c156104b30f",
                                                "text": "Calm is the morn without a sound,\n⁠Calm as to suit a calmer grief,\n⁠And only thro’ the faded leaf\nThe chestnut pattering to the ground: […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
