                                                "example_id": "8121ed18-1697-45fa-97b5-3c592400a998",
                                                "sense_id": "18970b2a-3dec-3114-9933-d0fcd7b5ad1c",
                                                "text": "It was a calm ; so, forming a tandem of three boats, we commenced the slow business of towing the trophy to the Pequod."
